# Monorepo：关键路径检出 LF（本文件保持 LF）。若大批量调整换行约定，须在合适窗口并由维护者执行 `git add --renormalize .`。
# README / AGENTS 对换行有更短说明。
.github/**/*.yml text eol=lf
.github/**/*.yaml text eol=lf

**/package.json text eol=lf
**/tsconfig*.json text eol=lf

apps/client/src/**/*.ts text eol=lf
apps/client/src/**/*.tsx text eol=lf
apps/runner/src/**/*.ts text eol=lf
apps/web/src/**/*.ts text eol=lf
apps/web/src/**/*.tsx text eol=lf
apps/api/src/**/*.ts text eol=lf

packages/*/src/**/*.ts text eol=lf

tools/playwright-field-probe/**/*.ts text eol=lf

e2e-playwright-zhizhu-web/**/*.ts text eol=lf
e2e-playwright-zhizhu-web/**/*.tsx text eol=lf
e2e-playwright-zhizhu-web/**/*.mjs text eol=lf

scripts/**/*.ts text eol=lf
scripts/**/*.mjs text eol=lf

# 一键部署脚本：bash 在 Linux/macOS 不接受 CRLF，必须强制 LF
deploy/*.sh text eol=lf
